To get a 3D model:

1. Download a free GLB model from:
   - https://sketchfab.com (filter by "Downloadable" and "GLB")
   - https://polyhaven.com/models
   - https://free3d.com

2. Or create your own using:
   - Blender (export as GLB)
   - Three.js Editor (https://threejs.org/editor/)

3. Place your model.glb file in ./assets/model.glb

For testing, you can use a simple cube model from Three.js examples.

